␀./main/ui/views/setup_wizard_view.cpp␀␀␀Your phone, off the grid.␀␀␀Build %s␀␀␀␀Get started␀Both have the camera, voice memos, radio and Petdoku. You can run this setup again from Settings.␀␀␀Choose your setup␀␀␀With an SD card. Adds offline maps, Wikipedia, music and the file manager. Photos go to the card.␀␀␀Full␀␀␀␀No card needed. Photos and memos stay in the phone's own memory, which holds about 15 photos.␀␀␀Mini␀␀␀␀Maps and Wikipedia live on it. Any size works; 8 GB holds Czech maps and Wikipedia.␀Insert the SD card␀␀Pick now, download on a computer later.␀What goes on the card?␀␀MAPS␀␀␀␀No maps␀Czechia, detailed␀␀␀Whole world, overview␀␀␀WIKIPEDIA (TEXT, NO PICTURES)␀␀␀No Wikipedia␀␀␀␀Czech␀␀␀English␀Czech and English␀␀␀Open this page on a computer. Your picks are already ticked there.␀␀Get the files␀␀␀%s#content?maps=%s&wiki=%s␀␀QR code for %s failed
